    <field name="staff_user_ids" eval="[(4, ref('base.user_admin'))]"/>
    <field name="message_intro"><![CDATA[<h6>✨ Premium / Spa Services</h6>
<ul>
<li><p><strong>De-matting</strong> – untangling severe knots in long-haired breeds.</p></li>
<li><p><strong>Coat Conditioning Treatments</strong> – special shampoos, oils, or masks.</p></li>
<li><p><strong>Creative Grooming</strong> – coat dyeing, fur sculpting, accessories (bows, bandanas).</p></li>
<li><p><strong>Seasonal Packages</strong> – “Summer cut” or “Winter coat maintenance.”</p></li></ul>
<p>For pets that deserve the extra touch, our premium and spa services transform routine grooming into a relaxing, pampering experience. These treatments go beyond the basics to provide luxurious care tailored to special coat and skin needs.</p>
<p>Options include de-matting for long-haired breeds prone to tangles, coat conditioning masks that nourish and revitalize fur, and creative grooming such as coat dyeing or sculpted styles for unique looks. We also offer seasonal packages like a “Summer Cut” to keep your pet cool, or “Winter Coat Care” for warmth and comfort during colder months.</p>
<p>Every premium treatment is performed with patience and attention to detail, ensuring your pet not only looks their best but also enjoys the process. Perfect for special occasions, show preparation, or simply because your companion deserves a spa day.</p>]]></field>
